<div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">

  {# About Horizon Aid #}
  <div class="mb-5">
    <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">About Horizon Aid</h1>
    <p>Horizon Aid is a humanitarian organization providing emergency relief, healthcare, education, and community development to vulnerable communities around the world. Our teams work in crisis and under-served regions — from Somalia to Ukraine to Guatemala — delivering programs in education, women's support, agriculture, medicine, and health.</p>
    <p>This page documents the design system that powers Horizon Aid's website: a starterkit theme built on <a href="https://getbootstrap.com/">Bootstrap 5</a> and Single Directory Components (SDC) with <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/drupal/releases/10.1.0">Drupal ~11</a>, so our team can build and update program pages, appeals, and country profiles quickly and consistently.</p>
  </div>

