    <div class="mb-4">
      <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">How Varbase Provides You with Value</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Moved from old ways to new generative ways.</li>
        <li>Using Single Directory Components (SDC) which all components are listed in Varbase Components</li>
        <li>Supporting Storybook in Varbase Projects</li>
        <li>No support for sub-themes, Only Generate your custom cloned theme from the Vartheme BS5 Horizonaid Starter kit.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-light p-4">
      <p class="mb-0 opacity-75">Do not think of Vartheme BS5 Horizonaid as a base theme, It is a starter kit theme. It has template mapping with Single Directory Components.</p>
